About Us
GEA provides a variety of services to the Greeneville, TN area and surrounding areas. We are a community-owned, full-service utility providing electric, water, and fiber services. Being a community owned utility, we keep the focus on what matters most to us: our community.
Our Mission
To provide our community with reliable and affordable utilities that will help our community grow and reach its full potential.
Our Utility
Our utility was founded in the early 1900s. Our utility has been serving the community of Greeneville, TN and surrounding areas ever since.
Our Team
Our team is made up of dedicated professionals committed to providing the best service to our community.
Contact Us
We are always here to help! If you have any questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to contact us.
